<title>BELGIUM: EU clears VIAG-Kloeckner buy of Hoogovens.</title>
<headline>EU clears VIAG-Kloeckner buy of Hoogovens.</headline>
<text>
<p>BRUSSELS, Aug 6 (Reuter) The European Comission said on Wednesday it had cleared the acquisition of sole control of Ods Hoogovens by BV Aluminium Verkoop Zuid, a subsidiary of Kloeckner Stahl.</p>
</text>
